            Move '        Set object_shadow_state of (oBtn1(self)) to (not(liLogImage))' to sLine
            Move '        Set Enabled_State of (oBtn1(self)) to liLogImage' to sExpected
            Get Tokenizer of ghoFuncLib sLine to TokenizerData
